# M-panic-location, panel 230's R1: an element written past the end of an array
# names where `xs[at]` begins. The bound is asked in the program's C before
# `hero_array_set`, whose own check stays behind it as an invariant.

function main()
    xs: [i64] @= [1, 2, 3]
    at: i64 @= 2
    xs[at] @ 7
    print(xs[at])
    at @ at + 1
    xs[at] @ 8
    print("unreached")
